  "description": "♥ There are 10 pages in total – each one can be printed as many times as you want.\n♥ Each page is explained in the presentation photos, please look for a better understanding.\n♥ This Minimalist Bullet Journal Setting is perfect for all year round planning.\n♥ The Pages are UNDATED so you can use this over and over again each year.\n♥ This is a minimalist design for those of you that like a clean layout and its also perfect for those of you that like to draw on their planners.\nWHAT IS INCLUDED?\n-> 1 ZIP file with 4 PDF files in 4 different sizes: A4 – A5 – LETTER – HALF LETTER\n!!! 1 PDF FILE CONTAIN ALL 10 PAGES !!!\n-> If you want to print only one of these pages you can simply choose which one from the printing settings. (change number of pages)\nPLEASE NOTE:\n-> There are no printed materials / physical products will be shipped.\n-> Simply print from your home printer or send it to a local printing shop.",
